up message appears: \"Jayden has left\". The whiteboard with the equation \"3/4 x 3/1 = 9/4\" remains on screen.\nTurn 1. STUDENT: Starting in two minutes.\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 27 seconds] Background noises of movement.\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 72 seconds] Student makes various noises. The student's webcam feed disappears at 02:13. A notification \"Jayden has left\" appears at 02:48.\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 7 seconds]\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [SCREEN_UPDATE] A notification \"Jayden has joined\" appears.\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 17 seconds]\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 39 seconds] The student's webcam turns on at 03:14.\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [SCREEN_UPDATE] A notification \"Mr. Rivera has joined\" appears. The screen layout changes to show the student's webcam feed and a black screen for the tutor.\nTurn 2. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 7 seconds] The tutor's webcam turns on.\nThe whiteboard view is restored, showing the scribbles from the beginning. Both webcams are visible.\nTurn 2. TUTOR: Sorry about that.\nTurn 3. STUDENT: Hello.\nTurn 4. STUDENT: You should get me in Fortnite.\nTurn 5. TUTOR: Oh dude, I haven't even played.\nTurn 6. STUDENT: Why?\nTurn 7. TUTOR: Cuz life has been busy.\nTurn 8. STUDENT: What level are you?\nTurn 9. TUTOR: Um, last time I checked, probably like one seventy something.\nTurn 10. STUDENT: That's cuz I played a lot.\nTurn 11. STUDENT: Why are you level three and seventy?\nTurn 12. TUTOR: That's cuz I played a lot earlier this summer.\nTurn 13. STUDENT: Dang.\nTurn 14. STUDENT: I'm only a level like, level one hundred and ten.\nTurn 15. TUTOR: Oh, wow. Oh. Nice.\nTurn 16. STUDENT: So I need like sixty more levels to catch up to you.\nTurn 17. TUTOR: Yeah.\nTurn 18. TUTOR: How was the uh, Giants game?\nTurn 19. STUDENT: Good.\nTurn 20. TUTOR: Did the Giants win?\nTurn 21. STUDENT: No.\nTurn 22. STUDENT: They were close though. Six to one. I mean not six to one, six to five.\nTurn 23. TUTOR: Oh, okay.\nTurn 24. TUTOR: [PAUSE: 6 seconds]\nTurn 24. TUTOR: Gotcha.\nTurn 25